      "description": "Take control of your health with Cardiora: Blood Pressure, the ultimate blood pressure monitor and heart rate monitor app designed for everyday use. Whether you want to keep a detailed blood pressure log, analyze your heart rate, or track your blood sugar levels, this all-in-one health tracker helps you monitor, record, and understand your vital signs in real time.\n\nMain Features of Cardiora: Blood Pressure:\n- Blood Pressure Monitor - Easily measure blood pressure, record daily blood pressure, and follow your blood pressure trends.\n- Heart Rate Monitor - A reliable pulse checker and heart monitor. Get general heart rate results with insights into heart rate variability, stress levels, and overall heart health.\n- Blood Sugar Tracker - Log and track blood sugar levels and manage your blood sugar monitoring effectively. \n- Oxygen & HRV - Measure oxygen monitoring, follow cardiac stress, and check rate variability.\n- Step Counter & Heart Age - Track steps, calories, and distance walked. Estimate your heart score and assess potential health risks.\n\nWhy Choose Cardiora: Blood Pressure?\n- Track and monitor blood pressure anytime, anywhere.\n- Organize a detailed log blood pressure and log blood sugar history.\n- Stay motivated to lead a healthier lifestyle with daily blood pressure tracking and energy monitoring.\n\nCardiora: Blood Pressure is not just a pressure monitor, it’s your complete handy health tracker. This blood pressure calculator provides everything you need to track blood pressure, monitor sugar levels, and maintain your heart health every day.\n\nThis app is designed only for recording your blood pressure data. It does not measure blood pressure and cannot replace professional medical diagnosis or advice. Always consult your doctor before use.\n\nWe prioritize the security of your health data. Your blood pressure records are kept confidential and accessible only to you.\n\nThis Cardiora: Blood Pressure always needs your recommendation and feedback to be immensely improved. We’d like to receive further suggestions from our beloved users with a deep sincerity. Thank you very much.\n\nPrivacy URL: https://tdmt-stars.netlify.app/privacy\nTerm of Use: https://tdmt-stars.netlify.app/eula",
